  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Outside Heaven Overseeing Tower, after Duke Long weathers a joint siege, Fang Yuan and Heavenly Lord Bai Zu send killer moves at the same time. Fang Yuan uses myriad ghost sword dragon. Heavenly Lord Bai Zu uses this move. Sword qi rampages and ghost dragons fill the sky on one side. The two moves drown Duke Long from all directions. From amidst that sea, Duke Long calls them good moves but not enough. Qi current scissors cut the dragons like paper. The centipedes are smashed into fragments that scatter in the air. Duke Long is unharmed.",
